sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Verified user
 participant API as Profile / Venue APIs
 participant DB as PostgreSQL
 U->>API: GET /users/{id}/profile OR /sports OR /venues OR /venues/{id}/opening-hours
 API->>API: University guard, method and query validation
 alt Invalid access/method/query
 API-->>U: 401 / 403 / 405 / 400
 else Valid
 API->>DB: Read profile/sport interests OR sport/venue/opening-hour rows
 alt Target missing
 API-->>U: 404 where applicable
 else Found
 API->>API: Map public fields, paginate venue list
 API-->>U: 200 JSON, no-store
 end
 end
 Note over API,DB: Read operations do not reserve a venue or create membership
